NOTE ON DATA / 資料授權說明

The MIT license above covers the source code in this repository only.

- data/words.js is derived from the vocabulary reference list published by
  Taiwan's College Entrance Examination Center (大學入學考試中心
  《高中英文參考詞彙表》, effective from the 111 academic year). The word list
  itself remains the property of its publisher and is included here only for
  non-profit personal study use. The original PDF is not redistributed in this
  repository.
- Chinese glosses, phonetics and word forms come from ECDICT
  (https://github.com/skywind3000/ECDICT), an open-source dictionary, converted
  to Traditional Chinese with OpenCC (s2twp).
- Example sentences, grammar notes and trap warnings in data/sentences.js and
  data/grammar.js are written for this project and covered by the MIT license.

If you are the rights holder of the vocabulary list and would like the derived
data removed, please open an issue.
